&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Business Apps Supply Chain team is an innovative group of product and technology enthusiasts focused on creating and deploying next-generation solutions in the Supply Chain domain. We are transforming how enterprise solutions are built driven by our customers&#39; business critical problems. Our team strikes an ideal balance between deep technical execution (including advanced data engineering and AI tooling) and a sharp customer focus to create highly impactful products that accelerate value realization across our customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will gain experience in the Supply Chain and related processes and act as the interface between customers, our Go-To-Market and our Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams, shaping the future of Celonis’ product offering in this domain. Take this chance to rethink the way companies run their Supply Chain processes, with a specific focus on Procurement and help our customers to accelerate their value realization with Celonis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Application Product Manager for Procurement, you will operate at the intersection of customer-facing solution engineering and core product innovation to architect and deploy cutting-edge enterprise AI solutions. In this hybrid role, you will partner directly with strategic customers to build bespoke, composable procurement and supply chain architectures using the Celonis Context Model (CCM) and advanced decision intelligence. By leveraging modern AI tooling and LLM-based coding agents, you will abstract field insights into reusable semantic libraries, directly accelerating Celonis&#39; global agentic deployment workflows. You get hands-on: prototyping on the platform, wiring up data, building AI-driven solutions, and iterating directly with the people who&#39;ll use them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to make the vision of AI-powered solutions a reality by building products that turn the cutting edge capabilities of the Celonis&amp;nbsp; Platform from strategy into solutions that customers use to run their Procurement processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Solution Blueprinting:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct collaborative discovery workshops to uncover root-causes and operational inefficiencies, mapping ambiguous customer needs into clear technical scopes and comprehensive solution blueprints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context Model &amp;amp; Solution Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute hands-on deployments of customer-specific context models, data structures, and end-to-end supply chain blueprints within the Celonis platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Customer Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Own customer deployments end-to-end from initial kickoff to live production, presenting complex architectural solutions and strategic value narratives directly to cross-functional stakeholders and executive teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype &amp;amp; Test Functions:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, validate, and test use-case-specific decision intelligence functions, including e.g. optimization algorithms and predictive models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Deconstruct monolithic application architectures and translate deployment learnings into reusable semantic entities and modular context libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about Procurement, Supply Chain, the Celonis technology, and what it can do for our customers, here&#39;s your chance to directly contribute to taking our Celonis Platform and Context Model to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience as a Solution Engineer, Product Engineer, Technical Product Manager, Founding/Forward-Deployed Engineer, Implementation Consultant or a comparable technical, customer-facing role hybrid role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive knowledge of core operational workflows in supply chain and procurement. You can speak the language of C-suite executives and seamlessly connect complex, systemic bottlenecks to strategic AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building coherent solutions, not just isolated features. You think in terms of the whole solution and how the pieces fit together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in data analysis and data modeling including tools native to the Celonis platform: SQL, Python, quick to pick up new tools and platforms and able to prototype and build. Experience with platform-native tools like PQL is a significant asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced architectural mastery of LLM orchestration, tool use/function calling, RAG, agents, prompt engineering, and agentic patterns for enterprise workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on exposure to enterprise architectures, with ERP systems (such as SAP or Oracle) or Material Requirements Planning (MRP) logic considered a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated project management capabilities accompanied by excellent planning and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creativity in problem-solving, a solution-oriented mindset, and the ability to work autonomously while collaborating smoothly across multi-disciplinary squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills and the willingness to work very closely with customers and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in spoken and written English (knowledge of German is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;118&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;121&quot; data-end=&quot;136&quot;&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt; Account Executive – New Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote within Austria, Germany, Spain, Italy, Sweden or Poland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Full professional English and Portuguese&lt;/strong&gt;. Any other European language spoken in our markets (e.g. Spanish, German, Italian, French, Polish) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least 5 years in B2B sales with a clear focus on outbound&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €40,000 – €50,000 gross/year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Join fiskaly! Finance that looks forward, not just backward.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At fiskaly, innovation drives us. We&#39;re reshaping the landscape of fiscal compliance with our cloud-based solutions for electronic receipts and invoices. Our team thrives on diversity and collaboration, committed to creating a supportive environment where everyone&#39;s contributions are valued. Join us to play a key role in our mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼 &lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Account Executive – New Business to build a pipeline and close business in new markets. This is an outbound-first role: you will open doors that are not yet open, through cold calling, email, video, LinkedIn and whatever creative prospecting gets you in front of the right person. You own the opportunity from first touch to signature, and you stay close to your customers after the deal is done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be selling into POS providers, billing and invoicing software vendors, ERP partners and retail technology companies — technical buyers who care about API quality and business buyers who care about staying on the right side of the law. Both conversations are yours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️ &lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate your own pipeline through consistent, high-quality outbound activity: cold calls, sequenced email, video, LinkedIn and creative prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the full funnel: prospecting, discovery, solution mapping, negotiation, contract signing and post-sale support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the funnel moving: open new opportunities while advancing the deals already in play, with the discipline to do both every week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become genuinely credible on the fiscalization and e-invoicing regulations in your markets, so you can answer legal and basic technical questions without needing to escalate every time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate a technical API product into clear business value for non-technical buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Legal and Solution Engineering on the questions that genuinely need them, and bring the market&#39;s objections back into the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep your pipeline data clean and your forecast honest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;👀 &lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years in B2B sales with a strong outbound track record — you have built pipeline from nothing, not just worked inbound leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full professional English and Portuguese&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any other European language spoken in one of our markets is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credible presence: you can hold a room with a CFO, a product lead and a developer in it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A very good listener — you ask the second and third question, not just the first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methodical and self-directed, with the discipline to keep activity consistent when nobody is checking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to explain complex, regulated topics simply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset: you enjoy an environment where the playbook is still being written and you are expected to help write it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, competitive and coachable, and honest about what you don&#39;t know yet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;It will really impress us if you already have experience in the VAT world — e-invoicing, fiscal reporting or tax compliance software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International experience in a European startup or scaleup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in compliance, accounting, billing software, POS or PMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling an API-based or otherwise technical product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✅ &lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vacation days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours and a hybrid setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget for personal and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware of your choice (Windows/Mac)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that is open, direct, and pragmatic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;Why fiskaly&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining fiskaly means contributing to a mission-driven company that is redefining how compliance is done in Europe and beyond. Here, you&#39;ll grow, innovate, and make a real impact on the finance operations of a scaling SaaS company.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fastly helps people stay better connected with the things they love. Fastly’s edge cloud platform enables customers to create great digital experiences quickly, securely, and reliably by processing, serving, and securing our customers’ applications as close to their end-users as possible — at the edge of the Internet. The platform is designed to take advantage of the modern internet, to be programmable, and to support agile software development. Fastly’s customers include many of the world’s most prominent companies, including GitHub, Yelp, Paramount, and JetBlue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building a more trustworthy Internet. Come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Account Executive - DACH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of Fastly’s DACH Sales team, you will be in charge of identifying, working and closing opportunities in high-growth mid market/ commercial accounts across Germany, Austria and Switzerland. You will drive proactive outbound sales opportunities and respond to inbound demand, to work those opportunities from initial qualification to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will execute on the go to market plan to deliver maximum new business bookings and revenue while managing complete and complex sales-cycles, often presenting to partners the value of our platform. You will structure and execute daily, weekly and monthly plans to improve prospecting, meetings, presenting follow-up calls, including preparing for calls by using Sales Engineer resources, and debriefing the team on the outcome and next steps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to join our german team to drive growth within an expanding market with additional support from the EMEA organisation. It is a unique opportunity to build upon the community and the great set of premier customers already in love with Fastly products and services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prospecting to generate pipeline in DACH region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accountable for driving new business acquisition, revenue growth and meeting or exceeding quota goals and targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effectively and independently deliver the Fastly company story, value proposition and product demonstrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and execute a comprehensive sales and account plan, with the support of the team lead, to drive customer acquisition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prepare and manage proposals and quotes, plus ensure the closing of deals and contracts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure account management for closed accounts to seek additional revenue opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Accelerate customer adoption and ensure customer satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Managing all aspects of the sales cycle including: prospecting, sales campaign/meetings, negotiation close, account management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure you identify the decision-makers, stakeholders and users of services related to Fastly in order to prospect, sell and ensure the sales cycle is driven to deliver the greatest success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and maintain daily and weekly plans to maximize prospecting via phone, email and other means, plus planning your time for prospect follow up, customer engagement etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with Sales Engineering, Marketing, SDR´s&amp;nbsp; and/or Product Teams when appropriate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with marketing and customer development to ensure aligned plans to enable success against goals and objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal Industry Experience: Cloud, SaaS/PaaS with Security experience or Edge Computing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A demonstrable track record of technology (B2B, SaaS, Cloud or Software) related sales or business development experience with senior leadership and C-level executives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Direct field experience in selling within Commercial and mid-size businesses in the region at the least.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with cloud technologies and content delivery network services, security services, content management, web analytics, website performance, cloud storage, mobile content delivery or managed web hosting is highly desired.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of prospecting, managing and close sales, managing accurate pipeline and forecast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Independent with an entrepreneur mindset, self-disciplined and possess strong verbal and written communications skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hunter Mentality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curiosity and a desire to understand a customer’s industry/business and meet their unarticulated and unmet needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrates an insatiable appetite to learn and improve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Curious, Problem-solver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eagerness to work hard, exceed expectations and outperform quotas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency in German and English.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Work Location(s) &amp;amp; Travel Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is a remote position based in Germany, with the possibility of becoming a hybrid position as Fastly expands its presence in the region and may open an office there in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position may require travel to the US and Internationally, as required by your role or requested by your manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care about you. Fastly works hard to create a positive environment for our employees, and we think your life outside of work is important too. We support our teams with great benefits that start on the first day of your employment with Fastly. Curious about our offerings?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to meet your needs. Our offerings may vary depending on the country where you work and are subject to change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Fastly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have a huge impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fastly is a small company with a big reach. Not only do&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/customers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;our customers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;have a tremendous user base, but we also support a growing number of&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/open-source/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;open source projects and initiatives&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;Outside of code, employees are encouraged to share causes close to their heart with others so we can help lend a supportive hand.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We value diversity.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Growing and maintaining our inclusive and diverse team matters to us. We are committed to being a company where our employees feel comfortable bringing their authentic selves to work and have the ability to be successful -- every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are passionate.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fastly is chock full of passionate people and we’re not ‘one size fits all’. Fastly employs authors, pilots, skiers, parents (of humans and animals), makeup geeks, coffee connoisseurs, and more. We love employees for who they are and what they are passionate about.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re always looking for humble, sharp, and creative folks to join the Fastly team. If you think you might be a fit please apply!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; A fully completed application and resume or CV are required when applying.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All job applications must be submitted through our official careers site at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fastly.com/careers&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;www.fastly.com/about/careers&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. We will never request sensitive information, such as your Social Security number, bank account or credit card information during the application process. All official communication will come from an @&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://fastly.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;fastly.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; or @&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://recruiting.fastly.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;recruiting.fastly.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; email address. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fastly is committed to ensuring equal employment opportunity and to providing employees with a safe and welcoming work environment free of discrimination and harassment. Our employment decisions are based on business needs, job requirements and individual qualifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to age, ancestry, color, family or medical care leave, gender identity or expression, genetic information, marital status, medical condition, national origin, family or parental status, physical or mental disability, political affiliation, protected veteran status, race, religion, sex (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Consistent with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) and federal or state disability laws, Fastly will provide reasonable accommodations for applicants and employees with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation is needed to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and/or to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, please contact your Recruiter, or the Fastly Employee Relations team at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----- style=&quot;font-weight: ----- style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; or 501-287-4901.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fastly collects and processes personal data submitted by job applicants in accordance with our&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Please see our&lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.fastly.com/privacy-job-applicants&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;privacy notice for job applicants&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW142035299 BCX0&quot;&gt;Resolve to Save Lives (RTSL)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; is a global health organization that partners locally and globally to create and scale solutions to the world’s deadliest &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;health threats. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Millions of people die from preventable health threats. We collaborate to close the gap between proven, life-saving solutions and the people who need them. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Since 2017, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;we’ve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; worked with governments and other partners in more than 60 countries to save millions of lives. We work toward a future where people live&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;longer, healthier lives, communities flourish, and economies thrive. This is an ambitious vision, and it inspires us and our partners to make progress every day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Purpose:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategist, Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt; strengthens the capacity of RTSL and its government partners to use data, digital systems, and artificial intelligence to improve public health programs and decision-making. Working across RTSL&#39;s program portfolio, the role brings together public health strategy, data architecture, digital transformation, and AI governance to identify high-value opportunities and help translate them into practical, sustainable approaches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Strategist advises program and country teams on data architecture, interoperability, data governance, and AI readiness; shapes and prioritizes data- and AI-enabled initiatives; and builds RTSL&#39;s capacity to use emerging technologies responsibly and effectively. Externally, the role works with governments, technical partners, and the broader global health ecosystem to advance country-owned approaches to stronger data systems and responsible AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in the role means that RTSL and its partners are making better-informed decisions about where and how to invest in data and AI, with stronger underlying data systems, clearer standards and safeguards, and practical applications that deliver measurable public health value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Duties and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Data Strategy and Architecture&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise RTSL program and country teams and government partners on strengthening the data foundations needed for effective public health programs, including data architecture, quality, interoperability, metadata, governance, accessibility, and appropriate data use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure teams understand how data flows across systems and identify fragmentation, duplication, quality issues, and other barriers to effective program management and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support governments and partners in developing practical, sustainable approaches to data architecture and interoperability that strengthen existing systems and promote country ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate public health and program needs into clear data requirements and help bridge communication among public health, epidemiology, product, data, and technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure high standards for data quality, usability, interoperability, governance, privacy, and sustainability in collaboration with IT, Legal, and relevant technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track developments in health information architecture, interoperability standards, digital public goods, analytics, and related fields and assess their implications for RTSL&#39;s programs and country partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applied AI, Innovation, and Responsible Use&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape RTSL&#39;s approach to the responsible programmatic use of AI and advanced analytics, ensuring that investments are driven by public health problems and measurable value rather than technology alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and prioritize high-value opportunities where AI could improve planning, implementation, clinical or public health decision support, analysis, monitoring, or learning -- in close collaboration with program, country, and digital teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide structured assessment of proposed AI use cases, considering the problem to be solved, user and workflow needs, data readiness, feasibility, public health value, equity, privacy, safety, sustainability, and country context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise teams on whether to build, buy, adapt, or partner for data- and AI-enabled solutions, emphasizing reuse, interoperability, sustainability, and fit for purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with organizational leadership, IT, and Legal to translate RTSL&#39;s AI policies and principles into practical guidance and appropriate review processes for programmatic applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote responsible AI practices, including appropriate human oversight, transparency, accountability, privacy, equity, and mechanisms for identifying and responding to risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead responsible experimentation and learning, helping RTSL distinguish promising innovations from approaches that are not sufficiently useful, feasible, or sustainable to pursue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Program Advisory and Organizational Capability&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior resource to RTSL&#39;s program and country teams, helping them integrate data and AI considerations into program design, implementation, monitoring, and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop practical frameworks, decision aids, guidance, and tools that enable teams to assess data and AI opportunities consistently and rigorously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build organizational capability in AI and advanced tools through training, coaching, communities of practice, and practical learning opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams develop sufficient AI and data literacy to engage effectively with technical experts, vendors, government counterparts, and partners and make informed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic input to digital product and innovation initiatives where broader questions of data architecture, interoperability, AI, or cross-program applicability are relevant, while leaving product ownership and delivery with the responsible technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture and share learning from data, digital, and AI initiatives across programs and countries, ensuring that evidence, successes, and failures inform future strategy, investment, and implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;External Advisory, Partnerships, and Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise government and public health partners on data architecture, interoperability, governance, organizational readiness, and responsible AI adoption in primary health care, epidemic preparedness, and other areas relevant to RTSL&#39;s mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with organizations shaping global health data standards, digital public goods, responsible AI, and related technical approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent RTSL in relevant technical forums and partnerships with governments, funders, multilaterals, academic institutions, technology partners, and peer organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring external developments and country experience back into RTSL to inform organizational strategy and program design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the VP, IT to align programmatic data and AI needs with enterprise technology, cybersecurity, data protection, and infrastructure requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Legal and Shared Services on governance, procurement, compliance, contracting, budgeting, and risk management associated with data and AI initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Development and Communications to support proposals, donor engagement, external communications, and clear articulation of RTSL&#39;s approach and learning in public health data and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 12 years of progressively responsible experience spanning data, digital health, health information systems, analytics, applied AI, or related areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in global public health and with Ministries of Health, national public health institutes, or other government health institutions, preferably across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working on data architecture and systems, including areas such as interoperability, data standards, metadata, governance, information flows, or data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating complex public health problems into practical data, digital, analytics, or AI approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience operating at the intersection of strategy and implementation and working effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience assessing digital or AI initiatives for feasibility, value, risk, sustainability, and organizational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with digital products, health information systems, digital public goods, technology vendors, or implementation partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building organizational capability or supporting adoption of new technologies and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising senior government, organizational, or partner stakeholders is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Skills &amp;amp; abilities&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong public health and systems thinking, with the ability to understand how technology, data, people, workflows, institutions, and policy interact to affect program outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data architecture, interoperability, data governance, data quality, and the foundations required for effective analytics and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of responsible AI principles, including privacy, equity, transparency, safety, human oversight, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enough technical fluency to engage credibly with data scientists, engineers, architects, and vendors while translating technical issues for public health and organizational leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and strategic judgment, including the ability to distinguish promising opportunities from technology-driven solutions without sufficient public health value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to structure ambiguous problems, identify underlying needs, and translate them into practical recommendations and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent facilitation, influencing, and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across organizational boundaries and build alignment without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to communicate complex data and technology concepts clearly to government officials, program leaders, donors, and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cultural awareness and ability to work effectively with partners in diverse and resource-constrained settings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic, curious, collaborative, and comfortable working in areas where technology and evidence are evolving rapidly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Education&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree or equivalent advanced training in public health, health informatics, digital health, data science, epidemiology, health policy, computer science, information systems, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Other&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a remote, globally distributed organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to travel internationally for country engagement, technical consultations, and organizational meetings as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in primary health care, cardiovascular health, epidemic preparedness, surveillance, or health systems strengthening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with relevant health data and interoperability approaches such as FHIR/HL7, WHO SMART Guidelines and Digital Adaptation Kits, DHIS2, OpenMRS/OpenHIE, and digital public goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying AI or advanced analytics to real-world public health or health system problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in multilingual and resource-constrained implementation environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in languages in addition to English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation and Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Resolve to Save Lives prides itself on cultivating a supportive, connected remote team doing work that matters. We do everything possible to ensure our employees are connected and set up for success. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary range for this position in the US is $165,000 to $195,000 annually. The exact offer will be determined by various factors, such as the candidate&#39;s skills and experience relative to the requirements of the role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For applicants based outside the US, salaries are set according to national labor rates for the international NGO sector.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, Resolve to Save Lives provides a generous package of benefits, including: &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance for you and your dependents &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributions toward retirement &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid annual leave and sick leave, in addition to public holidays &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two paid, week-long organization-wide breaks at mid-year and end-of-year &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development and home office setup benefits &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up-to-date computer equipment&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;RTSL believes its programs are strengthened when they are developed and supported by individuals with diverse life experiences whose understanding of social and cultural issues can help make our work and workforce more inclusive. We encourage applications from and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;provide&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; equal employment opportunities to all qualified applicants without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, ancestry, sexual orientation, national origin, age, disability, marital status, organ donor status, or status as a veteran. Resolve to Save Lives &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt;complies with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot;&gt; all applicable US EEO laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW71186963 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is best known for helping small businesses get paid — our Consumer tribe builds the other half of that story. We make SumUp Consumer, the wallet app that lets everyday consumers pay SumUp merchants with a tap, send money to friends, track their spending and earn loyalty rewards along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we grow SumUp Consumer across new markets and features, we need sharp, reliable insight into how people discover, adopt and use the product — and how that behaviour translates into sustainable commercial growth. This includes understanding our acquisition funnel, improving activation and conversion, increasing customer value, and reducing churn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Product Data Analyst to join the Consumer tribe and become the analytical partner for SumUp Consumer. You’ll work closely with Product Managers, Designers and Engineers, alongside our Analytics Engineering team, to understand customer behaviour, shape product strategy, and connect product performance to business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll help answer questions such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Which acquisition channels and customer segments generate the strongest long-term value?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where do customers drop out of the journey from acquisition to activation?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What drives repeat usage, retention and churn?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Which product changes improve conversion, customer value or commercial performance?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How should we prioritise product investments across markets and customer segments?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by meaningful analytical work, enjoy translating complexity into clarity, and want to see your insights directly influence both product decisions and commercial outcomes, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse customer behaviour and product performance across the full consumer lifecycle — from &lt;strong&gt;acquisition and activation through engagement, retention, churn and reactivation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve conversion, customer value and sustainable growth using funnel analysis, cohort analysis, segmentation and behavioural analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product Managers, Designers, Engineers and Data teams to ensure decisions are grounded in robust analysis, customer insight and commercial understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the performance of customer segments, markets, channels and product journeys, helping the team understand where growth opportunities and commercial trade-offs exist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support decisions that improve key business outcomes, such as activation, conversion, repeat usage, retention, churn, customer lifetime value and revenue-related metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct exploratory analysis to answer product and business questions, translating complex data into clear, commercially relevant recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, monitor and communicate core SumUp Consumer KPIs, covering acquisition, activation, engagement, conversion, retention, churn and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, execute and analyse A/B tests and product experiments, assessing both customer impact and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and reporting that stakeholders actively use, proactively surfacing trends, anomalies, performance risks and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help Product Managers assess the expected impact of opportunities and evaluate whether product investments are delivering the intended customer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Analytics Engineering to ensure KPI definitions, business logic and product instrumentation are accurate, scalable and trusted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a curious eye to AI and machine learning techniques, including LLM-assisted analysis, to speed up insight generation, customer understanding and product measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong SQL skills and are comfortable querying, analysing and validating data in a cloud data warehouse such as Snowflake, BigQuery or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience with product analytics techniques such as funnel analysis, cohort analysis, segmentation and behavioural analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand the commercial drivers of a digital product, including customer acquisition, conversion, activation, retention, churn and customer lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can connect customer behaviour and product performance to business outcomes, and use data to identify growth opportunities and inform prioritisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked on A/B tests or product experiments, with a solid grounding in the statistics behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re proficient in a visualisation tool such as Looker, Tableau or Power BI, with a track record of building dashboards that stakeholders actually use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can translate ambiguous product or business questions into structured analysis, and explain findings clearly to technical and non-technical audiences alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable assessing trade-offs, challenging assumptions and making recommendations based on evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about how AI and emerging techniques can improve product measurement, experimentation, customer understanding and commercial decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable managing multiple workstreams and stakeholders, with strong prioritisation and a proactive communication style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role does not support Visa sponsorship and candidates must have the right to work in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with a truly global, multicultural team from our central London Bridge location, wrapped in historic charm and modern flair. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave, plus bank holidays and special leaves&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget for attending conferences and/or advancing your career through further education&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏥 Health matters: private health insurance, including optical and dental&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚗 Life made easier: salary-sacrifice commuter benefits via Gogeta&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💼 Financial security: retirement scheme (SumUp matches 7% when you contribute 5%)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛡 Peace of mind: life insurance from MetLife for 2× your salary&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in our diverse team of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. Our core values lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our careers website, and follow our journey on LinkedIn, Instagram, and TikTok.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the AI Security Institute&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Security Institute is the world&#39;s largest and best-funded team dedicated to understanding advanced AI risks and translating that knowledge into action. We’re in the heart of the UK government with direct lines to No. 10 (the Prime Minister&#39;s office), and we work with frontier developers and governments globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re here because governments are critical for advanced AI going well, and UK AISI is uniquely positioned to mobilise them. With our resources, unique agility and international influence, this is the best place to shape both AI development and government action.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
